<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Biper eyes Nasdaq listing.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Biper eyes Nasdaq listing.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's Biper SA is planning to list shares in the United States via Nasdaq, Pedro Padilla, the beeper company's executive president, said Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;We intend to list our shares...in the Nasdaq in the next six months,&quot; Padilla said during a conference call with analysts. No further details were provided.</p>
<p>((--Cyntia Barrera, Mexico City newsroom +525 7289549))</p>
